      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_18817947eb0031f0ea14e16fc0f151a365f9e9fe39e4875438b670c2e1db2e26",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "A tractable ambient family need not remain statistically lawful after conditioning: equality intersections can create arbitrary Diophantine parameter sets, null local conditions defeat the positive-volume trace-formula selector, sparse conductor exhaustions alter vertical mixtures, and added arithmetic restrictions replace the original sampling problem.",
