      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Family operations propagate symmetry through representations: Rankin products tensor local parameters and multiply Frobenius–Schur indicators, while twisting pushes a product measure through scalar multiplication, allowing homogeneous type to be computed from a few trace moments without reconstructing the full Sato–Tate measure.",
